# Caddy reverse proxy with automatic HTTPS for AI Caption Studio.
# Install at /etc/caddy/Caddyfile (or import it) and `systemctl reload caddy`.
# Caddy provisions and renews the TLS cert automatically — the public https
# origin it serves must match PUBLIC_ORIGIN / RP_ID in .env.
#
# Requires: ports 80/443 reachable for ACME (public domain), or use Caddy's
# internal CA / a DNS-01 challenge for a tailnet-only hostname.

# Add this site to the central caddy (CT 114). The app runs on CT 153
# (caption-studio) at 10.63.21.12:3000 on vmbr1.
caption.linuxburken.se {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 10.63.21.12:3000
}
